{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21011","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21011-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21011-0","text":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21011-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21011-1","text":"上路时，她仍然对这趟远行一无所知。\n只知道终于能告别家中的百舌之声，躲避无处不在的明枪暗箭。\n直到她望向窗外时，她终于明白了那首诗的意味。\n「在某个时刻之后，我们不再行走，而是飞翔。」\n\n而她眼中闪动的亮光，正是行星的倒影。","speaker":""}]}
